- : log the actual rejection reason in  signature failures ().
- :  returns an empty diff when state roots match and no transactions touched addresses; falls back to full sync when state changed without touched addresses ().
- : require both  and  to be configured before enabling  gossip, eliminating follower auth failures caused by stale half-configured proposer identities ().
