### Pre-existing issue fixes

- fix(blockchain): include block_metadata in /rpc/block and the header cache so multi-validator signature validation has the PBFT certificate and attestations it needs for blocks fetched over HTTP (b7c4e0d22).
- fix(blockchain): log the actual rejection reason in sync_block_import signature failures (b7c4e0d22).
- fix(blockchain): get_state_delta returns an empty diff when state roots match and no transactions touched addresses; falls back to full sync when state changed without touched addresses (b7c4e0d22).
- fix(blockchain): require both proposer_id and proposer_key to be configured before enabling SyncManager gossip, eliminating follower auth failures caused by stale half-configured proposer identities (ba1f10499).
- fix(coordinator): quote rejected and active status literals in the 5d8339a13a12 backfill migration so the SQL compares against string values instead of non-existent columns (050cca219).
